From 60a5c5f0e6e9287be78eecf179b92a893e4f1747 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Lajosh=C3=A1zi=2C=20L=C3=A1szl=C3=B3=20Gergely?=
 <lajoshazilg@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 08:06:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/27] ASoC: wcd9335: add the headphone OCP fault interrupts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The codec reports left and right headphone over-current faults on INTR_REG
0, but the driver's regmap-irq table stopped after the SLIMbus interrupt on
that register, so neither was reachable. The shared MBHC implementation
requires both, and jack detection cannot be moved onto it while they are
missing.

The numbering is reused from the downstream driver, whose interrupt enum
runs FLL_LOCK_LOSS = 1, HPH_PA_OCPL_FAULT, HPH_PA_OCPR_FAULT, ... up to
MBHC_ELECT_INS_REM_LEG_DET = 12. That enum agrees with every value this
header already carries - WCD9335_IRQ_SLIMBUS at 0 and
WCD9335_IRQ_MBHC_SW_DET at 8 - which is what makes it safe to take the two
remaining positions from it: index 2 and 3, so INTR_REG 0 bits 2 and 3.

No type registers are declared for them, matching the electrical
insert/remove interrupts, which the same downstream table also leaves
without one.

Signed-off-by: Lajosházi, László Gergely <lajoshazilg@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.c | 8 ++++++++
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.h | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.c
index 845c57751..da79a5d49 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.c
@@ -5168,6 +5168,14 @@ static const struct regmap_irq wcd9335_codec_irqs[] = {
 			.type_reg_mask	= BIT(0),
 		},
 	},
+	[WCD9335_IRQ_HPH_PA_OCPL_FAULT] = {
+		.reg_offset = 0,
+		.mask = BIT(2),
+	},
+	[WCD9335_IRQ_HPH_PA_OCPR_FAULT] = {
+		.reg_offset = 0,
+		.mask = BIT(3),
+	},
 };
 
 static const unsigned int wcd9335_config_regs[] = {
diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.h b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.h
index 490fc4414..227509578 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.h
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd9335.h
@@ -626,6 +626,8 @@
 #define WCD9335_SLIM_PGD_RX_PORT_MULTI_CHNL_0(p) WCD9335_REG(0, (0x140 + 4 * p))
 
 #define	WCD9335_IRQ_SLIMBUS			0
+#define	WCD9335_IRQ_HPH_PA_OCPL_FAULT		2
+#define	WCD9335_IRQ_HPH_PA_OCPR_FAULT		3
 #define	WCD9335_IRQ_MBHC_SW_DET			8
 #define	WCD9335_IRQ_MBHC_ELECT_INS_REM_DET	9
 #define	WCD9335_IRQ_MBHC_BUTTON_PRESS_DET	10
